cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the associated article."
title: "Glioma survival prediction: TCGA development and CGGA external validation"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible pipeline for a transportability study of overall-survival
  prediction models in adult diffuse glioma, developed in TCGA and externally
  validated in CGGA, with separate discrimination and calibration assessment and
  a staged recalibration analysis.
